#, php-format
msgid "Form %s"
msgstr "Formular %s"

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-plugin.php:76
msgid ""
"OliForge CF7 Submission Guard requires Contact Form 7 to be installed and "
"active."
msgstr ""
"OliForge CF7 Submission Guard erfordert, dass Contact Form 7 installiert und "
"aktiviert ist."

